# Public build-time variables (no secrets here: the repository is public).
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key for the contact form. Without it the form is replaced by
# a "temporarily unavailable" notice. For local testing use the always-pass test key.
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=
# PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
